<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce Q3 net profit jumps 71 pct percent.</title>
<headline>Oce Q3 net profit jumps 71 pct percent.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>3rd qtr to Aug 31</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     1.90 vs   1.39</p>
<p>    Net profit			    38.9  vs  22.7</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		  1.12  vs 690.7 million</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    75.5  vs  50.8</p>
<p>    Leasing income			31.7  vs  27.3</p>
<p>    Interest charges		    26.7  vs  23.1</p>
<p>    Tax					9.8  vs   5.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Photocopier maker Oce-van der Grinten NV previously said it expected higher profits in the financial year 1995/96.</p>
</text>
